## Market

@harbormaster: Market day! Bring what you caught.
@narrator: The stalls go up at noon.
@harbormaster{when="holds(caught(marlin))"}: That marlin fetches five coins.
::sell{fish="marlin" price=5 when="holds(caught(marlin))"}
